WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.044
What if you feel uneasy and want to slow down, or pause completely?

2
00:00:04.044 --> 00:00:06.700
You are always in charge of the brake pedal.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.890
Drag your safety dial down or press Freeze anytime you want extra caution—it takes effect

4
00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.184
immediately without asking permission.
